OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist and fog patches should
OL,6,Fsoon clear, leaving a fine day with
OL,7,Flight winds and long spells of
OL,8,Fsunshine, although skies may be hazy
OL,9,Fat times. Feeling warm in places by
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and largely clear
OL,13,Fevening and night, turning chilly in
OL,14,Frural areas. Winds will strengthen
OL,15,Fover western hills, with some patchy
OL,16,Flow cloud developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
