OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA bright start but the cloud
OL,6,Fwill continue to build from the south,
OL,7,Fbecoming widespread and perhaps
OL,8,Fbringing a few outbreaks of drizzle,
OL,9,Fmostly over the hills. Turning breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWindy
OL,12,Fwith rain on Wednesday, locally heavy,
OL,13,Fclearing to sunny spells and isolated
OL,14,Fshowers. Further isolated showers on
OL,15,FThursday. Breezy and rather cloudy on
OL,16,FFriday. Temperatures closer to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
